{"t":"Mass Healing","s":"mass-healing-73b3f","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Mass_Healing_8212c7.gif","q":5,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Mass Healing</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Mass Healing\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mass_Healing_8212c7.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exura gran mas res</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">150</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Healing Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Cooldown_62226b.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Healing (1 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">36</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"basepower\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base Power</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">200</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p>Heals all players and summons around the caster and will also heal the caster.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Although this spell cannot restore as many hit points as certain other spells, it can still be considered to be the most powerful of all healing spells since its effect is not limited to a single target. Instead, every creature that is within the considerable range of effect of the caster will be healed. However, due to the large mental strain the mana cost of this spell should not be underestimated. Also, the druid should keep in mind that this spell will affect all targets, including any enemy that is within range! For this reason it is best to use the spell after combat when all opponents are slain and many members of the druid's party needs quick, effective healing. Please note that on optional PvP game worlds, this spell has no effect on wild creatures.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Heals all players and summons at a 4 tile radius, including the caster. The healing value changes according to the caster's <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> and magic level.\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mass Healing animation\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"288\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mass_Healing_animation_6404be.gif\" width=\"288\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-spell-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>It used to look like this:<br/>\n</p>\n<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mass heal1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"288\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mass_heal1_af1967.gif\" width=\"288\"/></span></center>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Healing_Spells\">Healing Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Bruise Bane</li><li>Cure Bleeding</li><li>Cure Burning</li><li>Cure Curse</li><li>Cure Electrification</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Cure Poison</a></li><li>Divine Healing</li><li>Fair Wound Cleansing</li><li>Gift of Life</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heal%20Friend\">Heal Friend</a></li><li>Intense Healing</li><li>Intense Recovery</li><li>Intense Wound Cleansing</li><li>Light Healing</li><li>Magic Patch</li><li>Mass Spirit Mend</li><li>Nature's Embrace</li><li>Recovery</li><li>Restoration</li><li>Restore Balance</li><li>Salvation</li><li>Spirit Mend</li><li>Ultimate Healing</li><li>Wound Cleansing</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["25-years-of-tibia-quest","cults-of-tibia-quest","the-first-dragon-quest","the-inquisition-quest","too-hot-to-handle-quest"]}